--- !u!114 &863830299
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 863830296}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4a5f6315f89dc4cedb3f244325cfc66e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  interactionMode: 0
  interactKey: 101
  freezePlayerDuringDialogue: 1
  requiredMaskId: 
  silentWhenLocked: 1
  lockedLines: []
  mainLines:
  - '[Janitor] Every winter feels worse than the last'
  - "Some girls who used to be well-behaved\u2026"
  - "they\u2019ve been corrupted by the society."
  - Coming back to the dorm later and later.
  - "Times aren\u2019t what they used to be."
  - <color=red> Last year, I even heard there was a terrible car accident in one
    of the nearby alleys. </color>
  - "Sigh\u2026 when people have too much money, \nOther people\u2019s life doesn\u2019t
    seem worth much anymore."
  - "Oh\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 "
  - "and something strange happened here on the playground last year. \nSomething\u2026
    unsettling"
  - <color=red> They said it had something to do with a snowman. </color>
  - It scared the previous dorm supervisor so badly she quit not long after.
  - I just hope none of that evil finds its way to me
  afterDialogueLines: []
  rewardMaskAfterTalk: 1
  rewardMaskId: 
  disappearAfterDialogue: 0
  disappearSound: {fileID: 0}
  disappearDuration: 1
  disappearAfterLeaveScene: 1
  npcUniqueId: NPC1
  enableDebug: 1
